[Music]  Adventurer I need your help have you  heard the news apparently other  adventurers were duplicating items to  sell in the next realm over to stop the  economy from being completely ruined the  mayor has shut off all methods for  making money  I guess they weren't using a consistent  database to protect against exploits so  I need you to venture ahead and tell  them about Cloud spanner  Adventure as you surely know Cloud  spanner is a relational database that  enforces strong consistency for  transactions and easily scales depending  on workload  spanner also allows Global applications  to interact with the data using  multi-regional configurations  zero downtime maintenance and online  schema changes with industry-leading  availability guarantees just add to the  benefits of spanner  these reasons make spanner a great  choice to ensure consistency for  critical interactions such as buying and  selling items between players in  multiplayer games er I mean adventurers  in other realms  oh you didn't know about spanner  okay here to help you get familiar with  spanner I have built a simulator that  manages player profiles to track Games 1  versus played statistics as well as the  ability to buy and sell on the trading  post please try it out  this simulator is written in go and  consists of four back-end rest API  microservices  the profile service handles player  registration  then the matchmaking service allows  those players to be assigned to game  simulations  when simulations are closed out one  winner is chosen and each player has its  stats updated for a number of games  played and if they won number of games  won  the item service allows players to  acquire items and money as game  simulations are being played and finally  the Trade Post Service allows players to  list items for sale for other players to  buy  this simulator leverages Locust a python  framework to generate workload to the  services  with a few commands you can easily start  signing up players and having them play  games and ultimately buy and sell items  from here it's easy to test how well  spanner holds up to the demand  as more players sign up more game  simulations can be created and more  items can be traded  when it comes time spanner can scale up  without impacting players to allow even  more capacity  so if you are building a multiplayer  game that demands High concurrency for a  distributed player base spanner is the  perfect foundation for success as you  embark on your journey to help prepare  you I am sharing two code Labs that go  over the simulator in depth these will  allow you to get Hands-On with an actual  application using Cloud spanner  when you are done you will be equipped  to fight back against exploits that ruin  game economies  at any time if you have any questions  please leave them in the comments Below  Good Luck Adventure  thank you

